Teewars Legacy
----------------------
What is Teewars legacy
	Teewars Legacy - inspired by teeworlds game made in 2000s opensource style with 2000s 
	technologies like SDL 1.2, SDL_mixer 1.2.
Features of project
- Oldschool sources structure like in 2000s games
- Oldschool pixelated GFX like in 2000s games
Recources
	TWL Website - https://teewarslegacy.com.ua/
